        Verse(chapter: 2, verse: "57",
              sanskrit: #"यः सर्वत्रानभिस्नेहस्तत्तत्प्राप्य शुभाशुभम् ।\#nनाभिनन्दति न द्वेष्टि तस्य प्रज्ञा प्रतिष्ठिता ॥"#,
              explanations: [
                .en: #"Continuing his portrait of the person of steady wisdom, Krishna says they are unattached everywhere: not thrilled when good things arrive, not upset when bad things do. Their wisdom stays fixed whatever happens. The lesson is that inner steadiness is not indifference to life but freedom from being thrown about by every turn of fortune."#,
              ],
